# Do NOT put the actual rules here.
#
# The authoritative keep rules live in:
#   src/main/keepRules/rules.keep
# AGP merges that directory into the AAR's proguard.txt, so consumers get the
# rules automatically just by depending on the AAR.
#
# This file is intentionally left as a pointer only. Having the rules in two
# places previously caused one copy to drift (the src/main/keepRules one had been
# left as the untouched AGP template), and the drift was invisible until the AAR
# was unpacked and inspected. One location, one source of truth.
